## Fiori Dashboard Features

### Page 1: Certification Management Dashboard
| Feature | What It Shows |
|:---|:---|
| **Total Certifications** | 50 total certificates in system |
| **Completed** | 30 certificates completed successfully |
| **Expiring Soon** | 12 certificates expiring in next 30 days |
| **Expired** | 8 certificates already expired |
| **Department Compliance** | Integration, Management, Cloud, Development, SAP |
| **Expiry Trend Chart** | Monthly breakdown of certificates expiring (Jan-Dec) |
| **Quick Actions** | Employee Data view, Send Alerts button |

### Page 2: Employee Data Table
| Column | Description |
|:---|:---|
| Name | Employee full name |
| Email | Wipro email address |
| Team | Development, SAP, Integration, Cloud |
| Competency | Frontend, SAP Fiori, SAP CPI, OpenShift, SAP PI/PO |
| Location | Pune, Hyderabad, Noida |
| Role | UI Developer, SAP UI5 Developer, Software Engineer, etc. |
| **Filters** | All Teams, All Locations, Search bar |

### Page 3: Employee Certificate Details (Example: Ram Kumar)
| Section | Details |
|:---|:---|
| **Completed** | SAP CPI Integration (Expired: 2026-03-01) |
| **Expired** | SAP ABAP (Expired: 2025-05-01) |
| **Pending** | SAP BTP Extension (70% progress) |
| **Expiring Soon** | Fiori/UI5 (Expiry: 2026-06-15) |
